Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?T9.1=20=E2=80=94=20admin-scoped=20React=20islan?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ds=20+=20/admin/kit=20proof=20page?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add @astrojs/react so the W9 admin workspace can be built as React islands
scoped to /admin/*. The public site and canvas overlay stay vanilla — no
reader page mounts a React component, so no public page loads the React
runtime.

- astro.config.ts: add the react() renderer integration.
- package.json: add react, react-dom (deps) and @astrojs/react, @types/react,
  @types/react-dom (dev). Nothing else — no Radix/shadcn/cmdk.
- tsconfig.json: react-jsx / jsxImportSource for .tsx.
- src/components/admin/KitProbe.tsx: trivial hydration-proof island.
- src/pages/admin/kit.astro: admin-gated proof page (same goTrue client gate
  as src/pages/admin/index.astro) mounting the island with client:load.

Verification (sandbox):
- npm run check + npm test green (59/59).
- build-diff working tree vs main: 70/70 existing pages byte-identical,
  0 changed, 0 removed; only /admin/kit added.
- dist grep: React chunks referenced only by dist/admin/kit/index.html.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
